dmehring@chaos.aoc.nrao.edu (David Mehringer) writes:

>I just got a segmentation fault while playing.  My level files still
>appear to be on disk.  I had this happen once before and tried to
>start again hoping that the game had been saved.  However, I was
>prompted for a character type and all of my levels dissapeared.  How
>can I restore the present game?

The game comes with a utility called 'recover' that you can use
to recover games. See the manual page.
If you don't have the recover utility, ask your system adminstrator.
If you *are* your system adminstrator, then get the source, go to
the 'utils' directory, and type 'make recover'.

